ef=f2e33]:\n        - strong [ref=f2e34]: Package facts can affect private golfer plans.\n        - generic [ref=f2e35]: Editing or archiving a linked package creates a new withdrawn plan revision, clears publication approval, and revokes active links until you review and publish again. Roadmap never treats an external click as a booking, purchase, or sale.\n      - generic [ref=f2e68]:\n        - heading \"Current packages\" [level=2] [ref=f2e70]\n        - list [ref=f2e71]:\n          - listitem [ref=f2e72]:\n            - generic [ref=f2e73]:\n              - strong [ref=f2e74]: Three-session contact phase\n              - generic [ref=f2e75]: A focused sequence for building predictable contact and transfer.\n              - generic [ref=f2e76]: Confirm current price with me · Use within eight weeks; rescheduling by agreement.\n            - generic [ref=f2e77]: active\n            - generic [ref=f2e78]:\n              - group [ref=f2e79]:\n                - generic \"Edit or archive this package\" [ref=f2e80]\n                - option \"Active\" [selected]\n                - option \"Draft\"\n                - option \"Booking\" [selected]\n                - option \"Purchase\"\n                - option \"Contact\"\n                - option \"Other\"\n              - alert [ref=f2e81]\n      - generic [ref=f2e36]:\n        - group \"Add a package you already sell\" [ref=f2e38]:\n          - generic [ref=f2e40]:\n            - generic [ref=f2e41]:\n              - text: Package name\n              - textbox \"Package name\" [disabled] [ref=f2e42]\n            - generic [ref=f2e43]:\n              - text: Why it fits\n              - textbox \"Why it fits\" [disabled] [ref=f2e44]\n            - generic [ref=f2e45]:\n              - text: Price in CAD (optional)\n              - spinbutton \"Price in CAD (optional) This is the instructor’s coaching-package price, not the Roadmap subscription.\" [disabled] [ref=f2e46]\n              - generic [ref=f2e47]: This is the instructor’s coaching-package price, not the Roadmap subscription.\n            - generic [ref=f2e48]:\n              - text: Current details when no price is shown\n              - textbox \"Current details when no price is shown Provide either an exact price or an honest current-details message.\" [disabled] [ref=f2e49]:\n                - /placeholder: Confirm current price with me\n              - generic [ref=f2e50]: Provide either an exact price or an honest current-details message.\n            - generic [ref=f2e51]:\n              - text: Material inclusions — one per line\n              - textbox \"Material inclusions — one per line List only what this package currently includes. Do not imply booking or payment has occurred.\" [disabled] [ref=f2e52]:\n                - /placeholder: \"Four individual lessons\\nWritten practice direction\\nEnd-of-phase review\"\n              - generic [ref=f2e53]: List only what this package currently includes. Do not imply booking or payment has occurred.\n            - generic [ref=f2e54]:\n              - text: Cadence (optional)\n              - textbox \"Cadence (optional)\" [disabled] [ref=f2e55]:\n                - /placeholder: Four lessons over six to eight weeks\n            - generic [ref=f2e56]:\n              - text: Practice expectation (optional)\n              - textbox \"Practice expectation (optional)\" [disabled] [ref=f2e57]\n            - generic [ref=f2e58]:\n              - text: Evaluation approach (optional)\n              - textbox \"Evaluation approach (optional)\" [disabled] [ref=f2e59]\n            - generic [ref=f2e60]:\n              - text: Terms\n              - textbox \"Terms\" [disabled] [ref=f2e61]:\n                - /placeholder: Sessions, expected window, expiry, rescheduling, and renewal terms.\n            - generic [ref=f2e62]:\n              - text: Existing HTTPS booking, purchase, or contact link\n              - textbox \"Existing HTTPS booking, purchase, or contact link Roadm