with blank phases\"\n                - option \"Three-phase contact progression (3 phases)\" [selected]\n            - note [ref=f2e681]:\n              - strong [ref=f2e682]: Three-phase contact progression\n              - paragraph [ref=f2e683]: A reusable three-step structure that preserves golfer-specific judgment.\n              - generic [ref=f2e684]: Your saved coach template — review it for this golfer before saving.\n            - button \"Apply phase structure\" [ref=f2e581] [cursor=pointer]\n        - group \"Starting assessment\" [ref=f2e583]:\n          - generic [ref=f2e585]:\n            - generic [ref=f2e586]:\n              - text: Starting assessment summary\n              - textbox \"Starting assessment summary\" [ref=f2e587]\n            - generic [ref=f2e588]:\n              - text: Strengths to preserve\n              - textbox \"Strengths to preserve\" [ref=f2e589]\n            - generic [ref=f2e590]:\n              - text: Primary observed pattern\n              - textbox \"Primary observed pattern State a coaching observation, not a medical diagnosis or guarantee.\" [ref=f2e591]\n              - generic [ref=f2e592]: State a coaching observation, not a medical diagnosis or guarantee.\n            - generic [ref=f2e593]:\n              - text: Evidence and assessment limits\n              - textbox \"Evidence and assessment limits\" [ref=f2e594]\n        - group \"Current priority\" [ref=f2e596]:\n          - generic [ref=f2e598]:\n            - generic [ref=f2e599]:\n              - text: Priority title\n              - textbox \"Priority title\" [ref=f2e600]\n            - generic [ref=f2e601]:\n              - text: Why this comes first\n              - textbox \"Why this comes first\" [ref=f2e602]\n        - group \"Directional phases\" [ref=f2e604]:\n          - generic [ref=f2e606]:\n            - text: Number of phases\n            - combobox \"Number of phases\" [ref=f2e607]:\n              - option \"3 phases\"\n              - option \"4 phases\" [selected]\n          - paragraph [ref=f2e608]: \"These phases are coach-authored direction, not promised outcomes or fixed timelines. Choose three or four before writing: switching to three hides any unsaved Phase 4 fields.\"\n          - generic [ref=f2e609]:\n            - generic [ref=f2e610]:\n              - heading \"Phase 1\" [level=3] [ref=f2e611]\n              - generic \"Phase 1 structure controls\" [ref=f2e612]:\n                - button \"Move up\" [disabled] [ref=f2e613]\n                - button \"Move down\" [disabled] [ref=f2e614]\n                - button \"Duplicate as Phase 4\" [disabled] [ref=f2e615]\n            - generic [ref=f2e616]:\n              - generic [ref=f2e617]:\n                - text: Phase 1 title\n                - textbox \"Phase 1 title\" [ref=f2e618]\n              - generic [ref=f2e619]:\n                - text: Phase 1 purpose\n                - textbox \"Phase 1 purpose\" [ref=f2e620]\n          - generic [ref=f2e621]:\n            - generic [ref=f2e622]:\n              - heading \"Phase 2\" [level=3] [ref=f2e623]\n              - generic \"Phase 2 structure controls\" [ref=f2e624]:\n                - button \"Move up\" [disabled] [ref=f2e625]\n                - button \"Move down\" [ref=f2e626] [cursor=pointer]\n                - button \"Duplicate as Phase 4\" [disabled] [ref=f2e627]\n            - generic [ref=f2e628]:\n              - generic [ref=f2e629]:\n                - text: Phase 2 title\n                - textbox \"Phase 2 title\" [ref=f2e630]\n              - generic [ref=f2e631]:\n                - text: Phase 2 purpose\n                - textbox \"Phase 2 purpose\" [ref=f2e632]\n          - generic [ref=f2e633]:\n            - generic [ref=f2e634]:\n              - heading \"Phase 3\" [level=3] [ref=f2e635]\n              - generic \"Phase 3 structure controls\" [ref=f2e636]:\n                - button \"Move up\" [ref=f2e637] [cursor=pointer]\n                - button \"Move down\" [ref=f2e638] [cursor=pointer]\n                - button \"Duplicate as Phase 4\" [disabled] [ref=f2e639]\n            - generic [ref=f2e640]:\n              - generic [ref=f2e641]:\n                - text: Phase 3 title\n                - textbox \"Phase 3 title\" [ref=f2e642]\n              - generic [ref=f2e643]:\n                - text: Phase 3 purpose\n                - textbox \"Phase 3 purpose\" [ref=f2e644]\n          - generic [ref=f2e645]:\n            - generic [ref=f2e646]:\n              - heading \"Phase 4\" [level=3] [ref=f2e647]\n              - generic \"Phase 4 structure controls\" [ref=f2e648]:\n                - button \"Move up\" [ref=f2e649] [cursor=pointer]\n                - button \"Move down\" [disabled] [ref=f2e650]\n                - button \"Duplicate as Phase 4\" [disabled] [ref=f2e651]\n            - generic [ref=f2e652]:\n              - generic [ref=f2e653]:\n                - text: Phase 4 title\n                - textbox \"Phase 4 title\" [ref=f2e654]\n              - generic [ref=f2e655]:\n                - text: Phase 4 purpose\n                - textbox \"Phase 4 purpose\" [ref=f2e656]\n          - generic [ref=f2e657]:\n            - generic [ref=f2e658]:\n              - text: Why Phase 1 leads the roadmap\n              - textbox \"Why Phase 1 leads the roadmap\" [ref=f2e659]\n            - generic [ref=f2e660]:\n              - text: Observable Phase 1 progress signals — one per line\n              - textbox \"Observable Phase 1 progress signals — one per line Use observable checks; do not promise a score or permanent change.\" [ref=f2e661]\n              - generic [ref=f2e662]: Use observable checks; do not promise a score or permanent change.\n        - generic [ref=f2e663]:\n          - heading \"Evidence details are optional at setup\" [level=2] [ref=f2e664]\n          - paragraph [ref=f2e665]: Complete the text-first roadmap now. After it is saved, the golfer hub provides a direct Evidence destination for lessons, observations, and later review notes.\n        - group [ref=f2e667]:\n          - generic \"Optional first-phase package\" [ref=f2e668] [cursor=pointer]\n          - option \"No package attached\" [selected]\n          - option \"Three-session contact phase\"\n        - generic [ref=f2e669]:\n          - heading \"Preview this unsaved golfer-view candidate\" [level=2] [ref=f2e670]\n          - paragraph [ref=f2e671]: Refresh the candidate after edits to review the exact words and phase order a golfer will see. Completing the draft then unlocks the full shared renderer for media, activity, print, and private-delivery review; it does not publish access.\n          - button \"Refresh golfer preview\" [ref=f2e672] [cursor=pointer]\n          - status [ref=f2e673]: No candidate is shown yet. Draft fields stay local until you explicitly save.\n        - alert [ref=f2e674]\n        - note [ref=f2e675]:\n          - strong [ref=f2e676]: Completion creates the first reviewable draft.\n          - generic [ref=f2e677]: It still does not publish, share, message, book, or charge. You must review the exact golfer view separately before creating private access.\n        - generic [ref=f2e678]:\n          - button \"Complete roadmap draft\" [ref=f2e679] [cursor=pointer]\n          - button \"Save and return later\" [ref=f2e680] [cursor=pointer]"}}
